              "answer": {
                "title": "回答",
                "value": "CouponsFab collaborates with retailers and brands to offer exclusive discounts\n                        and deals to its users. Users can search for coupons either by browsing through different\n                        categories or by searching for specific brands. Once they find a coupon they want to use, they\n                        can click on it to reveal the code or activate the discount. They can then use the coupon code\n                        during checkout on the retailer's website to avail the discount.",
